    <!-- 关于 -->
    <string name="about_app_name_title">OZJFLASH</string>
    <string name="about_app_name_value">A Compose based tool set with a built-in terminal and a rootless flashing workflow. Bundled binaries (adb, fastboot, bash, mke2fs, make_f2fs, payload-dumper-go and more) are unpacked into private storage and injected into the terminal PATH.</string>
    <string name="about_ui_title">Dual UI hosts</string>
    <string name="about_ui_value">Both interface hosts ship together: Miuix (MIUI style) and Material 3 Expressive. Switch between them in Settings → Interface style; all pages, bars and dialogs render natively in whichever host is active.</string>
    <string name="about_tools_title">Sources</string>
    <string name="about_tools_value">UI shell derived from KernelSU Manager (root / module / HTTP / JNI code removed); flashing binaries come from public platform tool builds. This app never requests or uses root.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_title">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_value">Flashing, unlocking bootloaders and modifying partitions can brick a device and void its warranty. Only use it on your own hardware for lawful repair, study and research. You take full responsibility for everything you do with this tool.</string>

